hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"17941","Yamur ibn Bishr narrated to us, he said, Abd Allah narrated to us, he said, Hushaym ibn Bashir narrated to us, from Dawud ibn Amr, from Busr ibn Ubayd Allah, from Samurah ibn Fatik al-Asadi, and he mentioned a hadith. He said, Yamur ibn Bishr narrated to us, he said, Abd Allah narrated to us, he said, Hushaym narrated to us, from Dawud ibn Amr, from Busr ibn Ubayd Allah, from Samurah ibn Fatik, that the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) said, What a fine youth is Samurah, if only he trimmed his forelock and raised his waist-wrapper. So Samurah did that; he trimmed his forelock and raised his waist-wrapper."
